{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/357828-what-s-the-final-fate-of-the-shadow-inquisition","id":357828,"title":"What's the final fate of the Shadow Inquisition?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-02T15:51:15-08:00","id":357828,"title":"What's the final fate of the Shadow Inquisition?","content":"The Society of Leopold is generally in charge of the secret crusade in the modern nights, but is there any canon word on what happened to the Shadow Inquisition tasked with the same during the Dark Medieval? I'm a big fan of the Knights of Acre, the Red Order, the Sisters of St. John, the House or Murnau, and the Oculi Dei? As far as I can tell, Hunters Hunted 2 makes no mention of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-03T01:03:05-08:00","id":358116,"title":"","content":"As I understand it, the Society of Leopold <i>is</i> the Shadow Inquisition. I believe its transition to the modern times was intended to be a mirror of the real-life Inquisition having never been fully disbanded, and simply transitioning into the modern Congregation for the Doctrine of the Faith. <br /> <br /> I don't know about canon stories on what happened to the various groups like the Red Order. Where there aren't any, one could certainly have some fun filling in the missing pieces. Some of them could have simple died out, while others changed in a variety of ways with the times. For real-life parallels, the Dominicans still operate numerous schools and monasteries around the world, while the Knights Templar aren't heard from anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}